BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Ratskin Family Band with Mother Of &amp\; Ensh
DTSTART:20261107T193000
DTEND:20261107T193000
UID:ed826c33bf5e4bcab72ecb413480437a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The Pilot Presents: The Ratskin Family Band with Mother Of &am
 p\; Ensh GUESS WHO&#x27\;S BACK AT THE PILOT?!?! The Ratskin Family Band i
 s the world&#x27\;s first and only all drag country band. Formed in April 
 2024\, the DIY &quot\;yallternative&quot\; group blends high-energy live d
 rag performance with classic country standards\, reimagined pop hits\, and
  original queer protest and roots music like their debut single “All You
  Fascists (Bound to Lose)”. At most drag shows\, performers are lip sync
 ing for their lives. But the Ratskin Family Band does not put on your typi
 cal drag show. When the self-proclaimed &quot\;first and only drag country
  band in the world&quot\; hit the stage\, everything is performed live. Jo
 ining these cuntry critters\, is Toronto&#x27\;s very own majestic alterna
 tive synth pop duo MOTHER OF X ENSH! Known for their outspoken activism\, 
 heavy beats and anthemic melodies\, this electropop doomer duo has been pe
 rforming alongside The Ratskin Family Band since the very beginning and is
  delighted to be sharing the stage with their hillbilly sisters once again
 ! Prepare to dance\, scream and let it all out on the dancefloor NOVEMBER 
 7TH AT THE PILOT! Follow The Ratskin Family Band on Instagram Follow Mothe
 r Of on Instagram Follow Ensh on Instagram 19+ All tickets are General Adm
 ission. No Refunds Doors Open at 7:30PM Show starts at 8:00PM Tickets: $5 
 Super Rare Early Advanced | $10 Early Bird | $15 in advance | $20 at the d
 oor Enjoy 10% off food with your ticket before or after the show - availab
 le on our main floor or rooftop patio! By purchasing a ticket\, you&#x27\;
 ll be added to The Pilot’s mailing list to receive updates on upcoming e
 vents and promotions. Your contact information may also be shared with the
  performers so they can keep you in the loop about future shows. You can u
 nsubscribe at any time. ‍
LOCATION:The Pilot Toronto\, 23 Cumberland St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/the-ratskin-family-band-with-mother-of-ens
 h
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
