BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Erotic Rituals to Practice Dying
DTSTART:20261110T190000
DTEND:20261110T190000
UID:44bf4cf87c02fb1dad9f55d9d0f0f591@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queer Death Salon is a virtual community space for all 2SLGBTQ
 IA+ people to come together to discuss death\, dying and grief. In Caffyn
 ’s work and play as a sacred intimate\, they have participated in many E
 rotic Rituals to resource and practice dying. They will offer a few embodi
 ed practices through which participants may wish to gently practice dying 
 before they die. Caffyn will also share from their personal experience of 
 sitting with the Spirit of Suicidality\, along with some relevant neurobio
 logy teachings from the art and science of Sacred Intimacy. Caffyn is a we
 ll-known teacher of Intimacy Education\, a writer and a queer elder. They 
 are the author of Love and Death in a Queer Universe\, Ecstatic Belonging\
 , Science for Sexual Happiness\, and many other books. (FOR MORE INFO SEE 
 TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
