 ight is BACK at The Drake Hotel this time we&#x27\;re doing a BIPOC night!
  🥂 Come after work &amp\; grab a cocktail\, catch the sunset\, play som
 e games\, and queer mingle with us 💖 We’re kicking things off with So
 cial Bingo\, our fav icebreaker for anyone who wants an excuse to say hi a
 nd meet someone new! And if you want to make your intentions a little easi
 er to read\, grab a colour-coded wristband: 🔴 Taken 🟡 It’s complic
 ated\, but open to flirting 🟢 Single &amp\; ready to (queer) mingle ⚪
  Poly &amp\; looking to explore 🔵 Here to make friends If you aren’t 
 ready to call it afterward\, The Drake’s rooftop is right upstairs for l
 ate-night bites and nightcaps 💫 Come for one drink\, leave with five fr
 iends. Your next group chat starts here 🫶 📍 The Drake Hotel - Modern
  Wing Lobby + Living Room | 1150 Queen St W (main floor) 🗓️ Friday\, 
 November 13th ⏰ 7:00pm–11:30pm 🎟 Early Bird: $10! $15 online | $20 
 cash at the door Only a limited number of tickets available! Link in bio 
 ♿ Venue access: No stairs required to enter the event space. Single-stal
 l\, gender-neutral washrooms are available. 🩷 Sapphic-centred event •
  Please be mindful of the space you take up and help centre BIPOC and tran
 s Sapphics. Allies are welcome\, please come as you are with the intent to
  uplift and celebrate the BIPOC community. ‍
LOCATION:The Drake Hotel\, 1150 Queen St West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-bipoc-cocktail-night
