  the longest-running queer open mic in Toronto! Free\, all-ages\, and any 
 art form\, from first draft to old favourites. It’s a place where your c
 reativity is held and celebrated! The November 2026 edition of Embrace wil
 l be held at our old home\, Glad Day! We welcome performer sign-ups both o
 nline ahead of the event day and in-person just before the event. Sign-ups
  will open on Nov 4th. You’ll find the sign-up form on our Linktree: htt
 ps://linktr.ee/ekembrace EMBRACE is a queer and trans-inclusive open mic n
 ight that provides space for folks to share art of all forms and levels. W
 e cater to all art forms such as poetry\, spoken word\, comedy\, dance\, l
 ive music\, drag\, storytelling and more. The perfect environment to share
  some words from your heart\, a song you&#x27\;ve been working on\, try ou
 t some new jokes\, or display some visual art\, we have the platform for y
 ou. If performing isn&#x27\;t your thing\, then join the audience as we su
 pport\, encourage\, and bask in the creativity with each other. (FOR MORE 
 INFO SEE TICKET LINK PROVIDED)
